findings:
- id: global-commands-ignore-yunta-home
  severity: major
  title: Global pack commands ignore the configured YUNTA_HOME state root
  location: crates/cli/src/pack/target.rs:29-33
  detail: Other user-level state resolves beneath YUNTA_HOME, but global_data_dir appends ~/.yunta, so users who rely on YUNTA_HOME cannot find the global installation.
- id: audit-misses-global-packs
  severity: minor
  title: Pack audit cannot inspect globally installed packs
  location: crates/cli/src/cli/pack.rs:76-88
  detail: After pack add --global, pack audit publisher/name still resolves only the project .yunta/packs directory and returns not installed.
